MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_001: Let's go, Bucephalus! Tyah!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_002: That should clear this area. B-but wait... Is that\nFather? And Mother?
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_003: No! It...it can't be... Aaaah!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_004: Oomph... Hrah!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_005: Promised One. I'm ashamed for how I acted on the\nbattlefield. There's no excuse.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_006: Seeing my parents like that though... Still, others\nare witnessing similar things here.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_007: As a temple soldier, I should have stayed in control.\nBelieve me, it'll never happen again.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_008: <NCA>"Is there something else that upset you?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_009: <NCB>"I'm surprised. You're usually so steady."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_010: <ACA>Well...maybe.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_011: <ACB>I'm not as strong as you think. But...you have a\nright to be surprised.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_012: The truth is...seeing my parents isn't what upset me\nso much.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_013: When I chose to fight the underworld, I knew I'd\nsurely see them again.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_014: I mourned them years ago—long ago. I could accept\nfighting them here. I know they'd want that.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_015: But then one of them said something...\nSomething horrific...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_016: <NCA>"What did you hear?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_017: <NCB>"Horrific?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_018: That thing that used to be my father was saying it,\nagain and again... How he and my mother died.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_019: "Brother...murderer..."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_020: Oh...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_021: That uncle of mine... He rigged the Heroic Games,\nsabotaging my opponents to keep me winning.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_022: He got me an Arc by pulling strings in the temples.\nUncle was...ruthless about getting what he wanted.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_023: I hated what he was doing, and in time we had our\nbig falling out. Still...he was my dear uncle.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_024: I...I owed him everything! He said my parents died in\nan accident. That's why he stepped in to raise me!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_025: But he...murdered my parents! He was the one who\nruined our lives!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_026: My parents were so kind. But their murder left them\nwith such deep resentment, they got stuck in death.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_027: I hate my uncle... And I hate myself for living in\nsuch stupid ignorance of everything...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_028: <NCA>"Resentment will get you stuck too."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_029: No, don't tell me what to do! I have every right in\nthe world to feel this way!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_030: Promised One, why do you look so sad?
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_031: <NCA>"Because you're so sad..."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_032: Ugh. Here I am worrying about my own problems,\nand there you are, always thinking of others.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_033: Thank you for that. I feel a little calmer now.\nReally, I'll be fine.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_A_034: With you and your spear leading the way, I know I'll\nstay on the right path. We all will.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_001: Oh, Promised One... I can't believe you're dead.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_002: I know you're upset too, Bucephalus... Wait, you're\nnot? Behind me? What do you mean...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_003: You're alive! It's a miracle! I really thought that was\nthe end!
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_032: 
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_004: Whoops. Sorry for the, uh, bear hug. Y-you aren't\ninjured, are you?
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_005: Good. Honestly, I'm so glad... You know, I wasn't\nsure I'd have a chance to tell you something.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_006: It's about my uncle. It...always comes back to him,\ndoesn't it? I've found out much more.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_007: Before his death, my father governed Tellus county.\nMy uncle...was taking advantage of that.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_008: He'd been feathering his nest for a long time, gaining\npolitical favor and influence with the temples.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_009: Then my father found out. He was going to publicly\ndenounce him, so my uncle killed him. And Mother.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_010: <NCA>"You discovered all of that—now?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_011: <NCB>"That's a lot you found out..."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_012: Oh, I have Bucephalus here to thank. We went\nback to my old family home, you see...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_013: He started nosing around the garden and got his\nhooves into some papers my parents buried there.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_014: Papers about the denouncement. They must have\nknown they were in a lot of danger.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_015: <NCA>"So, that's the end of it?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_016: Not really. My uncle disappeared when the war\nagainst the underworld intensified.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_017: Even if I showed the documents to someone, it's not\nas if they could punish him at this point.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_018: But he won't stay quiet for long. Eventually his\nambition will draw him back out into society.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_019: Once that happens, I'll wait for the right moment and\nI'll show the whole world who he really is. 
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_020: Once the truth is out in the open, he won't be able to\nhide anymore. And THAT will be the end of it.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_021: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_022: But there is...a little more. I found a letter my parents\nhad written for me among those papers.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_023: They said how sorry they were about just...\neverything. But they also wrote these words.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_024: "No matter what the years may bring, hold on to that\nlight of yours that always brightened our days."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_025: <NCA>"And you have, haven't you?"
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_026: <NCB>"Your parents would be proud."
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_027: <ACA>Yes, I did. Though my light would have gone dark\nif it wasn't for this one...and you too.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_028: <ACB>I'd like to think so. But I have this one here to\nthank...and you.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_029: Bucephalus has always been there for me, since I\nwas just a girl.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_030: <RSDS>You've been there for me too, dispatching my poor\nparents with your spear, saving me from darkness.
MID_SE_Ism_Ale_S_031: Let's do the same for others...everyone in the world\nwho needs someone to be there for them.